    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires complying with GDPR, hosting data within the EU, not transferring data outside the EU, protecting sensitive data with encryption pseudonymisation, grounding figures or factual statements in source documents, providing completeness of audit trail, explaining solution outputs, validating and signing deliverables, respecting auditor s independence, separation of duties, anti money laundering obligations." ;
