    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, we recognize the client's requirements regarding professional secrecy, confidentiality, data protection, and compliance with regulatory obligations such as GDPR. the key legal risks associated with this project include non-compliance with data protection regulations, breach of professional secrecy and confidentiality, and failure to adhere to anti-money laundering obligations." ;
