    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To mitigate the key legal risks associated with this project, we can leverage we experience in contracting with clients bound by professional secrecy, ensuring that we contractual framework does not compromise we professional obligations. we is familiar with the expectations of clients requiring confidentiality undertakings, reversibility, audit rights, and service levels, which are essential in addressing the client's requirements for strict partitioning of client files and protecting sensitive data. we can provide administrative attestations, including those related to we up-to-date social and fiscal obligations, which demonstrates we commitment to compliance. we professional liability insurance coverage of 10 million euros per claim also provides a safeguard against potential risks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
